say anything about China

00:26:32.010 --> 00:26:33.100
at the same exact time.

00:26:33.100 --> 00:26:35.330
We had a big problem with that in the NBA

00:26:35.330 --> 00:26:37.030
because they want
lucrative deals over there

00:26:37.030 --> 00:26:38.360
and contracts and all that.

00:26:38.360 --> 00:26:40.440
What do you make as far as what's happened

00:26:40.440 --> 00:26:41.453
