00:26:42.360 --> 00:26:44.380
- There's two things,
there's two parts of it.

00:26:44.380 --> 00:26:48.137
I'm going to highlight
the middle class ones,

00:26:48.137 --> 00:26:50.750
and then I'll get back
to the culture piece.

00:26:50.750 --> 00:26:51.583
(clears throat)

00:26:51.583 --> 00:26:52.416
The first thing is

00:26:52.416 --> 00:26:54.850
this is what the biggest problem
with my community, my race,

00:26:54.850 --> 00:26:56.520
is that we went through
this great middle class

00:26:56.520 --> 00:26:58.280
built on small business ownerships

00:26:58.280 --> 00:26:59.540
to a great elitist class,

00:26:59.540 --> 00:27:01.960
