then you become elitist.

00:27:12.230 --> 00:27:13.063
And what happens,

00:27:13.063 --> 00:27:15.940
you go from dirt poor to super rich.

00:27:15.940 --> 00:27:17.510
You really do believe you're all that.

00:27:17.510 --> 00:27:20.010
I mean, it's very easy
to get into that mindset

00:27:20.010 --> 00:27:21.980
