answers to everything else.

00:27:28.137 --> 00:27:28.970
(Dave laughs)

00:27:28.970 --> 00:27:29.803
The guy is so smart.

00:27:29.803 --> 00:27:32.660
If you ask him, he's so
bold and is never wrong,

00:27:32.660 --> 00:27:33.493
(clears throat)

00:27:33.493 --> 00:27:35.830
but that's what happens with
elitist, there's no balance.

00:27:35.830 --> 00:27:37.220
- He got pretty quiet on China, though,

00:27:37.220 --> 00:27:38.053
don't forget.
- Oh, yeah.

00:27:38.053 --> 00:27:39.990
- China, he suddenly didn't know much.

00:27:39.990 --> 00:27:41.680
- Oh, yeah. Oh, yeah.

00:27:41.680 --> 00:27:44.713
So that's the one piece is, unfortunately,

00:27:45.830 --> 00:27:47.800
we have too many elitists
who don't get it,

00:27:47.800 --> 00:27:49.360
and they will never understand

00:27:49.360 --> 00:27:50.550
what we're trying to go through.

00:27:50.550 --> 00:27:53.360
The other part of this is very simply,

00:27:53.360 --> 00:27:56.472
our culture has been under
attack for a long time.

00:27:56.472 --> 00:27:57.920
When you take away the family,

00:27:57.920 --> 00:28:00.450
you take away our faith of God,

00:28:00.450 --> 00:28:03.270
you take away things, very
simple things like respect.

00:28:03.270 --> 00:28:06.520
One thing that we had in our
community a day very simply,

00:28:06.520 --> 00:28:08.060
respect the God, country and family,

00:28:08.060 --> 00:28:09.890
and most of all, women.

00:28:09.890 --> 00:28:11.040
Never ever,

00:28:11.040 --> 00:28:12.640
