your ear of disrespecting mom

00:28:15.830 --> 00:28:19.973
because dad would be there
to make it right, big time.

00:28:21.727 --> 00:28:23.850
So when you don't understand
those basic respects,

00:28:23.850 --> 00:28:26.270
you don't understand that when
you're dealing with a coach,

00:28:26.270 --> 00:28:27.400
he's truly the coach.

00:28:27.400 --> 00:28:29.320
I mean, we came through an
era where the coach was...

00:28:29.320 --> 00:28:30.320
You know, he told you something,

00:28:30.320 --> 00:28:32.530
