00:29:17.640 --> 00:29:19.550
and de Blasio, I mean, I'm sorry,

00:29:19.550 --> 00:29:21.120
Goodell is no difference. (laughs)

00:29:21.120 --> 00:29:22.240
He's all about power.

00:29:22.240 --> 00:29:25.030
He wants to use these
kids, who have no clue

00:29:25.900 --> 00:29:28.730
